OL,3,GNEWSAEight birds glued to sticks in
OL,4,A'horrific incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe discovery of eight birds glued to
OL,7,Fwooden sticks has left the founder of a
OL,8,Fwildlife charity "heartbroken,
OL,9,Ffrustrated and angry".
OL,11,FSue Schwar from the South Essex
OL,12,FWildlife Hospital in Orsett said a
OL,13,Fmember of the public spotted a blue tit
OL,14,Fstruggling near a makeshift bird
OL,15,Ffeeding station in Wickford that had
OL,16,Fbeen surrounded by glue-coated wooden
OL,17,Fdowels.
OL,19,FShe said six blue tits and two great
OL,20,Ftits were taken to their hospital for
OL,21,Ftreatment on Thursday and were expected
OL,22,Fto make a full recovery.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
