OL,3,GNEWSAEight birds glued to sticks in
OL,4,A'horrific incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity confirmed it was working
OL,7,Fwith Essex Police and the RSPCA as part
OL,8,Fof an investigation into the "truly
OL,9,Fhorrific incident".
